  <!-- Sick node summaries. {0} = the node's name, {1} = how many pawns it holds, then {2} = the most urgent pawn's name and the next placeholder = that pawn's most urgent disease as the health tab heads it ("Flu (major): 52%"). The Threat forms are used when that disease is life-threatening. -->
  <!-- Care sentence after a group summary, built from vanilla's alert tests; parts join with a comma. -->
